WEBVTT

00:29:58.595 --> 00:30:01.558
AG: (Laughs) What? People tell you that?

00:30:01.582 --> 00:30:03.096
AM: Yeah.

00:30:03.120 --> 00:30:08.646
There is a sense of how
a Latina is supposed to self-present,

00:30:08.670 --> 00:30:11.746
and that can be a wild caricature.

00:30:11.770 --> 00:30:13.126
Now, I've got to say, Adam,

00:30:13.150 --> 00:30:16.706
I've also heard it from Latinas
on the complete flip,

00:30:16.730 --> 00:30:19.396
where their English is accented,

00:30:19.420 --> 00:30:23.686
and they're told that they need
to tone down their Latina-ness.

00:30:23.710 --> 00:30:25.188
So ...

00:30:25.212 --> 00:30:26.363
AG: Ugh.

00:30:26.387 --> 00:30:27.684
AM: It takes lots of forms.

00:30:27.708 --> 00:30:31.906
AG: If someone is pushing you
to fit their idea of your authentic self,